ation exception occurred; redirecting to authentication entry point (A Token was not found in the SecurityContext.) [] []\n[2012-08-31 21:18:23] security.DEBUG: Calling Authentication entry point [] []\n[2012-08-31 21:18:23] security.DEBUG: Write SecurityContext in the session [] []\n[2012-08-31 21:18:23] security.INFO: Populated SecurityContext with an anonymous Token [] []\n[2012-08-31 21:18:23] security.DEBUG: Write SecurityContext in the session [] []\n\nI still have to manually clear the cookie in the browser. Chrome 21 and IE9 acted the same on this. \n\nEverything is working BUT the enable/disable feature.\n\nNOTE: I am using PDO Session Storage... \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/comments/8209297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"reel","id":766170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjE3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/766170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel","html_url":"https://github.com/reel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]